[background arg="res://img/point_and_click/backgrounds/Game Jam 2026 Hunter Background 1.png" fade="0.0"]
join Hunter center
label hunter_greeting
if {recruitment.hunter_recruited} == true and {items.bow} == true:
	set {conversation.hunter} = true
if {hours} >= 2.0 and {items.bow} == true:
	set {conversation.bow_and_hours} = true
Hunter: "What are you doing out here?"
- "I'd like to buy a bow." | [if {items.bow} == false]
	Hunter: "A bow??? Wow! That'll be 6 gold."
	- Purchase [obtain bow upgrade] | [if {gold} >= 6.0]
		set {items.bow} = true
		set {gold} -= 6.0
		You now have the bow upgrade.
		Hunter: Remember, pointy side torwards enemy!
		jump hunter_greeting
	- "I don't have that much money."
		Hunter: "Thin ice buddy."
		jump hunter_greeting
- "Goblins will attack the town at nightfall." | [if {recruitment.hunter_recruited} == false]
	Doomsayer: "I'm planning to mount a defense from the church.\
	Will you join me?"
	Hunter: "Hehehe mount."
	Hunter: "Goblins huh...\
	What are those again?"
	Doomsayer: "...Little green people?"
	Hunter: "Ugh sounds awful count me in."
	label hunter_choice
	Hunter: "Shit wait, I've gotta set up some traps. If you help me out I'll join your little green slumber party or whatever."
	- Agree to help [lose 3 hours] | [if {hours} >= 3.0]
		set {recruitment.hunter_recruited} = true
		set {hours} -= 3.0
		set {recruitment.recruitees} += 1.0
		You and the hunter spend three hours setting up traps around the perimeter of the village. You hope that some of the goblins will get caught.
		Hunter: I just love traps, don't you?
		jump hunter_greeting
	- Offer to go hunting instead [locked - bow required] | [if {items.bow} == false]
		Hunter: Oh yeah? You're gonna chase down a deer and maul it to death? Come back when you've got a bow.
		jump hunter_choice
	- Offer to go hunting instead [lose 2 hours] | [if {conversation.bow_and_hours} == true]
		set {recruitment.hunter_recruited} = true
		set {hours} -= 2.0
		set {recruitment.recruitees} += 1.0
		You and the hunter spend two hours stalking deer in the forest. In the end, you manage to shoot one. The hunter is pleased with your marksmanship.
		Hunter: BAM right between the eyes. Got em good buddy.
		jump hunter_greeting
	- "I can't do that right now."
		Hunter: Then take a hike.
		jump hunter_greeting
- Return to the town square
	leave Hunter
	jump village/square